    "q-164376": {
      "dom_id": "step-q164376",
      "name": "Question 11",
      "problem": "What is the trace in the $xy$-plane of the hyperboloid of two sheets $-{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{16}=-1?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xy$-plane, we substitute $z=0$ into the equation of the hyperboloid. This gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+\\frac{{0}^{2}}{16} & =-1 \\\\ -{x}^{2}+{y}^{2} & =-1 \\\\ {x}^{2}-{y}^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is the equation of a hyperbola in $xy$-plane.",
