    "q-35409": {
      "dom_id": "step-q35409",
      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "What is the trace in the $yz$-plane of the hyperboloid of one sheet $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{5}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{3}=1?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $yz$-plane, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(0)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{5}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{3}=1 \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{5}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{3}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of the hyperbola in $yz$-plane.",
