    "q-164377": {
      "dom_id": "step-q164377",
      "name": "Question 14",
      "problem": "What is the trace in the $yz$-plane of the hyperboloid of two sheets ${x}^{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{3}=-1?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $yz$-plane, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the hyperboloid. This gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0}^{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{3} & =-1 \\\\ -\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{3} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{3} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is the equation of a hyperbola in $yz$-plane.",
